ase","donor_constant":"object zoom + 50 percent","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"drawminimap.cpp:96"}],"best_idea":"A player's map pings are capped at four live (the fifth prunes the oldest and starts a 2-second lockout), and the lockout is shortened to a quarter second when one of the player's own pings expires.","decision":"adapt","decision_why":"The cap, lockout and expiry rule fit Frankendom's server-verified rule for social markers, but the donor checks the lockout only in the local key handler; adapt moves the check to the server and counts in ticks. Reject the donor's Uint8 coordinates and sprite-id points of interest.","decision_status":"proposed","acceptance":"The fifth ping removes the oldest of the player's pings and shows a 2-second lockout bar; a server test rejects a new ping from a locked-out player and returns the remaining ticks; when one of the player's own pings expires the lockout drops to at most 250 ms."}
